BackOff` (事实 #2)，均符合应用在高负载或资源耗尽时的典型崩溃表现。\n\n现有证据已排除单纯的网络故障或应用代码逻辑错误，确认为资源限制配置不当引发的系统级终止。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.6m\n├─ 问题定位: 19.7s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 126.8s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-sbqvc: 126.8s (Evidence 118.7s, RCA 7.9s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 11.9s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-sbqvc**: pod-oomkilled\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 158.423, "metrics": {"run_id": "bf9c2eec43af4a71", "mttr": {"value": "2.6m", "seconds": 158.4288010597229, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-oomkilled", "pass": true, "score": 0.9, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-oomkilled"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 158428.8010597229, "llm_calls": 17, "llm_duration_ms": 114036.882